            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We present a case of an anomalous origin of the left circumflex coronary artery from the right coronary sinus passing between the pulmonary artery and the aorta (interarterial course) diagnosed by multidetector row computed tomography.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
